# Per-topic access control for the mutual-TLS listener.
# With use_identity_as_username, %u is the certificate common name.
# A patient publishes only under its own bed id, so bed-1 cannot write
# ward/bed-2/... . The collector may read every ward topic.

pattern write ward/%u/vitals/#
pattern read  ward/%u/vitals/#

user collector
topic read ward/#
